WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.879
Today we will coordinate movement with music. Our work connects with international

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:07.219
artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.033 --> 00:00:10.828
Choose two safe steps that suit the chosen rhythm.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.764
Connect them with a pause and a change of direction.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:21.040
Perform the phrase twice with control and enough personal space. Justify a revision

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.351
using evidence from another world tradition.
